Subject: [PATCH 1/3] recovered prototype: proto(eager): activate the probe
 side at build PARTITION finalize

Throwaway prototype. A finalize listener on the build PARTITION nominates the
join's probe producer (and the build CONCAT) as soon as the PARTITION pipeline
has finished, i.e. when the join's dynamic-filter session is terminal, instead
of waiting for the build CONCAT to deliver.

Switch SIRIUS_EAGER_PROBE: 0/unset = off, 1 = joins with an enabled filter
plan, 2 = every BUILD_PROBE join. SIRIUS_EAGER_CONCAT_FIRST (default 1).

Recovered by replaying the original agent transcript (original commit 092a0e3a).
---
